{"seq":1,"slug":"diffusion-theory","title":"扩散过程的数学理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/diffusion-models/diffusion-theory","wordCount":1720,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"扩散过程的数学理论\">扩散过程的数学理论</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>扩散模型的数学框架建立在两个互逆的随机过程之上：前向扩散过程逐步向数据添加高斯噪声直至完全破坏数据结构，反向去噪过程则学习逐步还原数据。DDPM（Denoising Diffusion Probabilistic Models）将这两个过程形式化为马尔可夫链，并通过变分推断推导出训练目标。这一框架的优雅之处在于：复杂的生成问题被分解为一系列简单的去噪子问题，每一步只需要预测并去除少量噪声。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    X0[x₀ 原始数据] --&gt; X1[x₁]&#10;    X1 --&gt; X2[x₂]&#10;    X2 --&gt; XT[xₜ ...]&#10;    XT --&gt; XN[x_T 纯噪声]&#10;    XN --&gt; RT[x_T-1]&#10;    RT --&gt; R2[...]&#10;    R2 --&gt; R1[x₁]&#10;    R1 --&gt; RX[x₀ 生成]&#10;    X0 -.-&gt;|前向加噪 q| XN&#10;    XN -.-&gt;|反向去噪 p_θ| RX\">graph LR\n    X0[x₀ 原始数据] --&gt; X1[x₁]\n    X1 --&gt; X2[x₂]\n    X2 --&gt; XT[xₜ ...]\n    XT --&gt; XN[x_T 纯噪声]\n    XN --&gt; RT[x_T-1]\n    RT --&gt; R2[...]\n    R2 --&gt; R1[x₁]\n    R1 --&gt; RX[x₀ 生成]\n    X0 -.-&gt;|前向加噪 q| XN\n    XN -.-&gt;|反向去噪 p_θ| RX</pre><p>前向过程是预定义的（无需学习），反向过程由神经网络参数化。训练时只需优化去噪网络预测噪声的能力，推理时从纯噪声出发逐步去噪即可生成新样本。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>数学表达</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>关键参数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前向过程</td>\n<td>q(xₜ|xₜ₋₁) = N(√αₜ xₜ₋₁, βₜI)</td>\n<td>逐步加噪</td>\n<td>噪声调度 βₜ</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反向过程</td>\n<td>p<em>θ(xₜ₋₁|xₜ) = N(μ</em>θ, σₜ²I)</td>\n<td>逐步去噪</td>\n<td>网络参数 θ</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边际分布</td>\n<td>q(xₜ|x₀) = N(√ᾱₜ x₀, (1-ᾱₜ)I)</td>\n<td>任意步直接加噪</td>\n<td>累积 ᾱₜ = ∏αᵢ</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>训练目标</td>\n<td>E[‖ε - ε_θ(xₜ, t)‖²]</td>\n<td>噪声预测损失</td>\n<td>时间步 t</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>噪声调度</td>\n<td>βₜ 从 β₁ 到 β_T 递增</td>\n<td>控制加噪速率</td>\n<td>线性/余弦调度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"前向扩散与噪声调度\">前向扩散与噪声调度</h2><p>前向扩散过程定义为一系列高斯转移核的马尔可夫链。在每一步 t，数据 xₜ₋₁ 被添加少量噪声得到 xₜ：q(xₜ|xₜ₋₁) = N(xₜ; √(1-βₜ) xₜ₋₁, βₜI)，其中 βₜ 是噪声调度参数。令 αₜ = 1 - βₜ 且 ᾱₜ = ∏ᵢ₌₁ᵗ αᵢ，可以推导出从 x₀ 到任意 xₜ 的直接采样公式：q(xₜ|x₀) = N(xₜ; √ᾱₜ x₀, (1-ᾱₜ)I)。</p>\n<p>这个闭式表达式是高效训练的关键——不需要逐步模拟前向过程，只需一步采样即可得到任意时间步的噪声数据：xₜ = √ᾱₜ x₀ + √(1-ᾱₜ) ε，其中 ε ~ N(0, I)。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import numpy as np&#10;&#10;class NoiseScheduler:&#10;    def __init__(self, n_steps=1000, beta_start=1e-4, beta_end=0.02, schedule=&#39;linear&#39;):&#10;        if schedule == &#39;linear&#39;:&#10;            self.betas = torch.linspace(beta_start, beta_end, n_steps)&#10;        elif schedule == &#39;cosine&#39;:&#10;            steps = torch.arange(n_steps + 1, dtype=torch.float64) / n_steps&#10;            alpha_bar = torch.cos((steps + 0.008) / 1.008 * np.pi / 2) ** 2&#10;            alpha_bar = alpha_bar / alpha_bar[0]&#10;            betas = 1 - alpha_bar[1:] / alpha_bar[:-1]&#10;            self.betas = torch.clamp(betas, max=0.999).float()&#10;        self.alphas = 1.0 - self.betas&#10;        self.alpha_bars = torch.cumprod(self.alphas, dim=0)&#10;        self.sqrt_alpha_bars = torch.sqrt(self.alpha_bars)&#10;        self.sqrt_one_minus_alpha_bars = torch.sqrt(1.0 - self.alpha_bars)&#10;&#10;    def add_noise(self, x0, t, noise=None):&#10;        if noise is None:&#10;            noise = torch.randn_like(x0)&#10;        sqrt_ab = self.sqrt_alpha_bars[t].view(-1, 1, 1, 1)&#10;        sqrt_omab = self.sqrt_one_minus_alpha_bars[t].view(-1, 1, 1, 1)&#10;        return sqrt_ab * x0 + sqrt_omab * noise\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NoiseScheduler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, n_steps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, beta_start</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1e-4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, beta_end</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.02</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, schedule</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'linear'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> schedule </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'linear'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.betas </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.linspace(beta_start, beta_end, n_steps)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        elif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> schedule </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'cosine'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            steps </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.arange(n_steps </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dtype</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">torch.float64) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n_steps</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            alpha_bar </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.cos((steps </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.008</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.008</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.pi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            alpha_bar </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alpha_bar </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alpha_bar[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            betas </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alpha_bar[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alpha_bar[:</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.betas </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.clamp(betas, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">max</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.999</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).float()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.alphas </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.betas</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.alpha_bars </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.cumprod(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.alphas, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.sqrt_alpha_bars </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.sqrt(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.alpha_bars)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.sqrt_one_minus_alpha_bars </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.sqrt(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.alpha_bars)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> add_noise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x0, t, noise</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> noise </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            noise </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.randn_like(x0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        sqrt_ab </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.sqrt_alpha_bars[t].view(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        sqrt_omab </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.sqrt_one_minus_alpha_bars[t].view(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sqrt_ab </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x0 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sqrt_omab </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> noise</span></span></code></pre></div><p>噪声调度策略直接影响生成质量。原始 DDPM 使用线性调度 βₜ ∈ [0.0001, 0.02]，在 T=1000 步后信噪比接近零。Improved DDPM 提出余弦调度，使得信噪比在时间轴上更均匀地下降，避免了线性调度在末期噪声下降过快的问题。余弦调度在低分辨率图像生成上效果更好，而高分辨率任务通常需要更多的总步数和更精细的调度设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反向去噪与变分目标\">反向去噪与变分目标</h2><p>反向过程的目标是学习 q(xₜ₋₁|xₜ) 的近似分布 p<em>θ(xₜ₋₁|xₜ)。在贝叶斯框架下，当 βₜ 足够小时，反向转移核也近似为高斯分布。DDPM 将反向过程参数化为 p</em>θ(xₜ₋₁|xₜ) = N(xₜ₋₁; μ<em>θ(xₜ, t), σₜ²I)，其中均值 μ</em>θ 由神经网络预测，方差 σₜ² 可以设为固定值或学习得到。</p>\n<p>通过变分推断，DDPM 的训练目标（负 ELBO）可以分解为 T 个去噪匹配项的和。每一项要求 p<em>θ(xₜ₋₁|xₜ) 逼近真实后验 q(xₜ₋₁|xₜ, x₀)。由于 q(xₜ₋₁|xₜ, x₀) 是可解析计算的高斯分布，训练目标可以进一步简化为预测添加的噪声：L_simple = E[‖ε - ε</em>θ(xₜ, t)‖²]。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 训练流程&#10;        A[采样 x₀ 从数据集] --&gt; B[采样 t 从均匀分布]&#10;        B --&gt; C[采样 ε 从标准高斯]&#10;        C --&gt; D[计算 xₜ = √ᾱₜ x₀ + √1-ᾱₜ ε]&#10;        D --&gt; E[网络预测 ε_θ xₜ t]&#10;        E --&gt; F[计算 MSE 损失]&#10;        F --&gt; G[反向传播更新 θ]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 训练流程\n        A[采样 x₀ 从数据集] --&gt; B[采样 t 从均匀分布]\n        B --&gt; C[采样 ε 从标准高斯]\n        C --&gt; D[计算 xₜ = √ᾱₜ x₀ + √1-ᾱₜ ε]\n        D --&gt; E[网络预测 ε_θ xₜ t]\n        E --&gt; F[计算 MSE 损失]\n        F --&gt; G[反向传播更新 θ]\n    end</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn.functional as F&#10;&#10;def train_step(model, x0, scheduler, optimizer):&#10;    batch_size = x0.shape[0]&#10;    t = torch.randint(0, scheduler.n_steps, (batch_size,), device=x0.device)&#10;    noise = torch.randn_like(x0)&#10;    xt = scheduler.add_noise(x0, t, noise)&#10;    noise_pred = model(xt, t)&#10;    loss = F.mse_loss(noise_pred, noise)&#10;    optimizer.zero_grad()&#10;    loss.backward()&#10;    optimizer.step()&#10;    return loss.item()&#10;&#10;@torch.no_grad()&#10;def sample(model, scheduler, shape, device):&#10;    x = torch.randn(shape, device=device)&#10;    for t in reversed(range(scheduler.n_steps)):&#10;        t_batch = torch.full((shape[0],), t, device=device, dtype=torch.long)&#10;        noise_pred = model(x, t_batch)&#10;        alpha = scheduler.alphas[t]&#10;        alpha_bar = scheduler.alpha_bars[t]&#10;        beta = scheduler.betas[t]&#10;        mean = (1 / alpha.sqrt()) * (x - (beta / (1 - alpha_bar).sqrt()) * noise_pred)&#10;        if t &gt; 0:&#10;            sigma = beta.sqrt()&#10;            x = mean + sigma * torch.randn_like(x)&#10;        else:&#10;            x = mean&#10;    return x\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn.functional </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> train_step</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(model, x0, scheduler, optimizer):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    batch_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x0.shape[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.randint(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, scheduler.n_steps, (batch_size,), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">device</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">x0.device)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    noise </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.randn_like(x0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    xt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scheduler.add_noise(x0, t, noise)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    noise_pred </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model(xt, t)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F.mse_loss(noise_pred, noise)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    optimizer.zero_grad()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    loss.backward()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    optimizer.step()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> loss.item()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@torch.no_grad</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sample</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(model, scheduler, shape, device):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.randn(shape, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">device</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">device)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> reversed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(scheduler.n_steps)):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        t_batch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.full((shape[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],), t, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">device</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">device, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dtype</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">torch.long)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        noise_pred </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model(x, t_batch)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scheduler.alphas[t]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        alpha_bar </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scheduler.alpha_bars[t]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        beta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scheduler.betas[t]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        mean </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alpha.sqrt()) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (beta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alpha_bar).sqrt()) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> noise_pred)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            sigma </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> beta.sqrt()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mean </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sigma </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.randn_like(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mean</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x</span></span></code></pre></div><p>噪声预测（ε-prediction）和数据预测（x₀-prediction）是两种等价但在实践中表现不同的参数化方式。ε-prediction 预测添加的噪声，在大多数时间步上表现良好；x₀-prediction 直接预测去噪后的数据，在低噪声时更稳定。v-prediction 是二者的线性组合：v = √ᾱₜ ε - √(1-ᾱₜ) x₀，在 Progressive Distillation 中被证明更利于蒸馏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"连续时间-sde-框架\">连续时间 SDE 框架</h2><p>Song 等人提出的 Score SDE 框架将离散的扩散过程推广为连续时间的随机微分方程。前向过程由 SDE dx = f(x, t)dt + g(t)dw 描述，其中 f 是漂移系数，g 是扩散系数，w 是标准维纳过程。对应的反向过程也是 SDE：dx = [f(x, t) - g(t)² ∇ₓ log pₜ(x)]dt + g(t)dw̄。</p>\n<p>这一框架的核心洞见是：反向 SDE 中唯一未知量是得分函数 ∇ₓ log pₜ(x)，可以通过训练得分网络来近似。不同的 f 和 g 选择对应不同的扩散模型：VE-SDE（Variance Exploding，对应 SMLD）使 f=0、g 递增；VP-SDE（Variance Preserving，对应 DDPM）使数据方差在整个过程中保持恒定。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;&#10;class VPSDE:&#10;    def __init__(self, beta_min=0.1, beta_max=20.0):&#10;        self.beta_min = beta_min&#10;        self.beta_max = beta_max&#10;&#10;    def beta(self, t):&#10;        return self.beta_min + t * (self.beta_max - self.beta_min)&#10;&#10;    def marginal_params(self, t):&#10;        log_mean_coeff = -0.25 * t ** 2 * (self.beta_max - self.beta_min) - 0.5 * t * self.beta_min&#10;        mean_coeff = torch.exp(log_mean_coeff)&#10;        std = torch.sqrt(1.0 - torch.exp(2.0 * log_mean_coeff))&#10;        return mean_coeff, std&#10;&#10;    def sde(self, x, t):&#10;        beta_t = self.beta(t)&#10;        drift = -0.5 * beta_t * x&#10;        diffusion = torch.sqrt(beta_t)&#10;        return drift, diffusion&#10;&#10;    def reverse_sde(self, x, t, score):&#10;        beta_t = self.beta(t)&#10;        drift = -0.5 * beta_t * x - beta_t * score&#10;        diffusion = torch.sqrt(beta_t)&#10;        return drift, diffusion\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VPSDE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, beta_min</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, beta_max</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.beta_min </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> beta_min</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.beta_max </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> beta_max</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> beta</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, t):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.beta_min </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.beta_max </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.beta_min)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> marginal_params</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, t):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        log_mean_coeff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.25</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.beta_max </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.beta_min) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.beta_min</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        mean_coeff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.exp(log_mean_coeff)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        std </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.sqrt(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.exp(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> log_mean_coeff))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mean_coeff, std</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sde</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x, t):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        beta_t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.beta(t)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        drift </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> beta_t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        diffusion </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.sqrt(beta_t)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> drift, diffusion</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reverse_sde</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x, t, score):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        beta_t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.beta(t)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        drift </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> beta_t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> beta_t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        diffusion </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.sqrt(beta_t)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> drift, diffusion</span></span></code></pre></div><p>连续 SDE 框架还引出了概率流 ODE（Probability Flow ODE）：dx = [f(x, t) - ½g(t)² ∇ₓ log pₜ(x)]dt。ODE 与 SDE 共享相同的边际分布 pₜ(x)，但采样过程是确定性的——给定相同的初始噪声，ODE 总是生成相同的图像。这一性质使得 ODE 采样更容易加速（使用自适应步长 ODE 求解器）并支持精确的似然计算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"去噪网络架构设计\">去噪网络架构设计</h2><p>扩散模型的去噪网络通常采用 U-Net 架构，它通过编码器-解码器结构加跳跃连接实现多尺度特征处理。时间步信息通过正弦位置编码转化为嵌入向量，然后通过 AdaGN（自适应组归一化）注入到每个残差块中。</p>\n<p>U-Net 的编码路径逐步降低空间分辨率并增加通道数，捕获从细节到全局的多尺度特征。解码路径逐步恢复分辨率，跳跃连接保证精细信息不丢失。自注意力层通常只在低分辨率特征图（如 16×16 和 8×8）上使用，以平衡表达能力和计算成本。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>典型配置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>残差块</td>\n<td>基本特征变换单元</td>\n<td>Conv-GN-SiLU-Conv + 跳跃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间嵌入</td>\n<td>注入时间步信息</td>\n<td>正弦编码 + MLP + AdaGN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自注意力</td>\n<td>捕获长程依赖</td>\n<td>多头注意力，低分辨率层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交叉注意力</td>\n<td>融合条件信息</td>\n<td>Q=图像特征，K/V=文本嵌入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>下采样</td>\n<td>降低空间分辨率</td>\n<td>步长为 2 的卷积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上采样</td>\n<td>恢复空间分辨率</td>\n<td>最近邻插值 + 卷积</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>DiT（Diffusion Transformer）用 Transformer 架构替代 U-Net，将图像分割为 patch 后作为 token 序列处理。DiT 在大规模训练中展现出更好的可扩展性，其性能随模型参数和训练计算量的增加而稳定提升，遵循类似 LLM 的 Scaling Law。Stable Diffusion 3 和 FLUX 已经采用了基于 Transformer 的架构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((扩散理论))&#10;    前向过程&#10;      高斯噪声注入&#10;      噪声调度策略&#10;      闭式边际分布&#10;    反向过程&#10;      去噪预测&#10;      变分目标推导&#10;      参数化方式&#10;    SDE 框架&#10;      VP-SDE 与 VE-SDE&#10;      概率流 ODE&#10;      得分函数统一&#10;    网络架构&#10;      U-Net&#10;      DiT Transformer&#10;      时间条件注入\">mindmap\n  root((扩散理论))\n    前向过程\n      高斯噪声注入\n      噪声调度策略\n      闭式边际分布\n    反向过程\n      去噪预测\n      变分目标推导\n      参数化方式\n    SDE 框架\n      VP-SDE 与 VE-SDE\n      概率流 ODE\n      得分函数统一\n    网络架构\n      U-Net\n      DiT Transformer\n      时间条件注入</pre><ul>\n<li>扩散模型通过前向加噪和反向去噪的对偶过程实现生成，训练目标简化为噪声预测的均方误差</li>\n<li>噪声调度策略决定了信噪比的变化曲线，余弦调度比线性调度更均匀</li>\n<li>连续 SDE 框架统一了不同扩散模型的数学基础，概率流 ODE 提供了确定性采样路径</li>\n<li>U-Net 是经典去噪架构，DiT 展示了 Transformer 在扩散模型中的可扩展性优势</li>\n<li>ε-prediction、x₀-prediction 和 v-prediction 是三种等价但实践表现不同的参数化方式</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"扩散过程的数学理论","id":"扩散过程的数学理论"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"前向扩散与噪声调度","id":"前向扩散与噪声调度"},{"level":2,"text":"反向去噪与变分目标","id":"反向去噪与变分目标"},{"level":2,"text":"连续时间 SDE 框架","id":"连续时间-sde-框架"},{"level":2,"text":"去噪网络架构设计","id":"去噪网络架构设计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"生成质量评估指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/generative-foundations/evaluation-metrics"},"next":{"title":"Stable Diffusion 架构解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/diffusion-models/stable-diffusion"}}